This repository is the public, reviewable source for the @adn/next edge connector.
It is published so customers and security teams can read the code that runs on
their origin. The ADN gateway, classifier, dashboard, and billing systems are
not included.

Install the published package from npm (`npm install @adn/next`). Do not treat
this tree as a second publish source of truth — versions are cut from the ADN
monorepo and mirrored here for review.
